      "text": "A heater full of thunder and a roof bowed low with snow",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 32.6,
      "end": 35.22,
      "text": "She could kiss me like a promise",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 35.22,
      "end": 37.72,
      "text": "Then accuse me with her eyes",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 37.72,
      "end": 42.36,
      "text": "By midnight every tender word was twisted into knives",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 42.36,
      "end": 47.34,
      "text": "I learned to read the weather in the muscles of her face",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 47.34,
      "end": 51.76,
      "text": "One minute I was everything, the next I was replaced",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 51.76,
      "end": 57.0,
      "text": "I tried to hold the center while the center would not stay",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 57.0,
      "end": 61.94,
      "text": "Love became a checkpoint at the ending of each day",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 64.82,
