      "text": "She was wild as the river when the ice breaks free",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 93.92,
      "end": 98.48,
      "text": "That woman was crazy and she was crazy for me",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 98.48,
      "end": 102.72,
      "text": "No more slam doors, no more avenue",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 102.72,
      "end": 107.62,
      "text": "Two, I will not call her number no matter what I do",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 107.62,
      "end": 110.82,
      "text": "But sometimes the cream is filled in summer",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 110.82,
      "end": 113.28,
      "text": "Mosquitoes in our hair",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 113.28,
      "end": 118.16,
