      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 119.1,
      "end": 124.06,
      "text": "Then jealousy would find us before we made it home",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 124.06,
      "end": 128.64,
      "text": "My coat out in the yard and my telephone gone",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 128.64,
      "end": 133.62,
      "text": "I tried patience, tried forgiveness, tried the careful things to say",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 133.62,
      "end": 138.32,
      "text": "But every breath became a test I had to pass that day",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 138.32,
      "end": 143.36,
      "text": "You can give somebody everything and still not give them rest",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 143.36,
      "end": 147.78,
      "text": "And wake up in the cold convinced you fail their test",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 150.5,
      "end": 155.18,
      "text": "Blue light rising over Chena in the spring",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 155.18,
      "end": 159.7,
      "text": "Her cheek against my shoulder not demanding anything",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 159.7,
      "end": 164.82,
